    "updated_at": "2024-04-05T22:53:23Z",
    "body": "Note that the rendered diffs still link to the versions of the images on whatwg.org, and thus don't show the changes.\r\n\r\nTo actually see the changes, go to each of the changed files in the Files tab, open the inspector on them (so you're in the context of the iframe displaying each file), and insert the following rules:\r\n\r\n```css\r\n.render-shell { color-scheme: dark; background: #222; }\r\n.render-shell img { background: none; }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat'll let you see how the original images fail, and how the new one succeed.",
