    "created_at": "2024-04-08T16:36:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-08T16:36:55Z",
    "body": "> It seems some colors changed in the parsing diagram,\r\n\r\nYeah, for unclear reasons the gradient fill for the boxes went from opaque white to half-transparent green, which ended up mixing in the underlying shadow filter and darkening it a little, *and* still letting some of the background thru. That all seemed pretty unintentional, so I made it fully opaque instead. I didn't change the colors otherwise, so the end result is it's a little lighter, since it's no longer partially mixed with the shadow. But it seemed like it was still reasonable looking, as you say, so I didn't do further adjustment to bring it closer to the original (accidental?) appearance.",
